{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Idle Frontier,\u00a0an idle cultivation &amp; village-building game where you become the divine architect of a mystical realm. Build your settlement, manage resources, train cultivators, and breathe new life into a hidden paradise. Your laid-back path to immortality begins here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Card-Based Building, Village by Design</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use cards to build and expand your village. Every layout choice\u2014from lumber camps to mining spots, from villager tasks to strategic upgrades\u2014shapes your unique immortal haven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224850/extras/1\u642d\u5efa\u6751\u5e84.gif?t=1746320095\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Cultivate While You Slack, Optimize Every Minute</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Minimize the game to keep it running in the background. Sneak in some village progress while you \u201cwork\u201d\u2014a true harmony of productivity and play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224850/extras/2\u6700\u5c0f\u5316.gif?t=1746320095\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore the Unknown, Battle Your Way Up</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roll the dice and step into dynamic encounters\u2014random events, deadly foes, and mini-game challenges await. Each decision brings new rewards\u2026 or risks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224850/extras/3\u63a2\u7d22\u6218\u6597.gif?t=1746320095\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Deep Systems, Endless Possibilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From refining pills and forging gear to mastering sect techniques and talent trees\u2014interwoven systems keep the gameplay rich and rewarding across all fronts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224850/extras/4\u5b97\u95e8\u5929\u8d4b.gif?t=1746320095\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Effortless Idling, Resources Flow In</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sit back and let the world work for you. Resources are gathered automatically, even when you're offline. Tap to grow, click to ascend\u2014cultivation has never been this chill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your Cultivation Journey Begins With a Tap. Idle progression, creative building\u2014relax and enjoy the life of an immortal pioneer, anytime and anywhere.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3224850?t=1746320095","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224850/287d27284507a1ab6fbb9247ddc3e3a8def96529/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746320095","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224850/80d634fb4d35e9f0d7207aa819780072f51db342/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746320095","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224850/80d634fb4d35e9f0d7207aa819780072f51db342/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746320095","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Idle Frontier,\u00a0an idle cultivation &amp; village-building game where you become the divine architect of a mystical realm. Build your settlement, manage resources, train cultivators, and breathe new life into a hidden paradise. Your laid-back path to immortality begins here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Card-Based Building, Village by Design</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use cards to build and expand your village. Every layout choice\u2014from lumber camps to mining spots, from villager tasks to strategic upgrades\u2014shapes your unique immortal haven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224850/extras/1\u642d\u5efa\u6751\u5e84.gif?t=1746320095\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Cultivate While You Slack, Optimize Every Minute</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Minimize the game to keep it running in the background. Sneak in some village progress while you \u201cwork\u201d\u2014a true harmony of productivity and play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224850/extras/2\u6700\u5c0f\u5316.gif?t=1746320095\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore the Unknown, Battle Your Way Up</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roll the dice and step into dynamic encounters\u2014random events, deadly foes, and mini-game challenges await. Each decision brings new rewards\u2026 or risks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224850/extras/3\u63a2\u7d22\u6218\u6597.gif?t=1746320095\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Deep Systems, Endless Possibilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From refining pills and forging gear to mastering sect techniques and talent trees\u2014interwoven systems keep the gameplay rich and rewarding across all fronts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224850/extras/4\u5b97\u95e8\u5929\u8d4b.gif?t=1746320095\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Effortless Idling, Resources Flow In</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sit back and let the world work for you. Resources are gathered automatically, even when you're offline. Tap to grow, click to ascend\u2014cultivation has never been this chill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your Cultivation Journey Begins With a Tap. Idle progression, creative building\u2014relax and enjoy the life of an immortal pioneer, anytime and anywhere.</p>","developers":["\u4e0d\u6015\u864e\u5de5\u4f5c\u5ba4"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224850/443cab9529da39bc3680a03cf83cbdac92f69f4d/header.jpg?t=1746320095","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257124526,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257124526/movie480.mp4?t=1746032723","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257124526/movie_max.mp4?t=1746032723"},"name":"Promotional Video","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257124526/94714fa3d963428e9fb96ab621638cb41f377344/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746032723","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257124526/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746032723","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257124526/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1746032723"}}],"name":"\u6478\u9c7c\u4ed9\u6751","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 +<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> I